    },
    {
      "id": "04-SU2-SO3.md#006",
      "path": [
        "04-SU2-SO3.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:lie-groups:04-su2-so3, git-history:lie-groups:04-su2-so3]",
        "canonical_path": "lie-groups/04-SU2-SO3.md",
        "concepts": "[su2, so3]",
        "current_path": "lie-groups/04-SU2-SO3.md",
        "id": "maxim:lie-groups:su2-so3",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "lie-groups",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[su2, so3]",
        "section": "lie-groups",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "SU(2) and SO(3) - Double Cover, Spinors, Angular Momentum",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "SU(2) = { [[a, -conj(b)], [b, conj(a)]] : a,b in C, |a|^2 + |b|^2 = 1 }"
    },
    {
      "id": "04-SU2-SO3.md#007",
      "path": [
        "04-SU2-SO3.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:lie-groups:04-su2-so3, git-history:lie-groups:04-su2-so3]",
        "canonical_path": "lie-groups/04-SU2-SO3.md",
        "concepts": "[su2, so3]",
        "current_path": "lie-groups/04-SU2-SO3.md",
        "id": "maxim:lie-groups:su2-so3",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "lie-groups",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[su2, so3]",
        "section": "lie-groups",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "SU(2) and SO(3) - Double Cover, Spinors, Angular Momentum",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Writing a = x_0 + i x_3 and b = x_2 + i x_1:\n```\nSU(2) = { x_0 I + x_1 (i sigma_1) + x_2 (i sigma_2) + x_3 (i sigma_3) : x_0^2+x_1^2+x_2^2+x_3^2 = 1}\n```\nThis is the unit sphere S^3 in R^4. So as a smooth manifold, SU(2) iso S^3."
    },
    {
      "id": "04-SU2-SO3.md#008",
      "path": [
        "04-SU2-SO3.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:lie-groups:04-su2-so3, git-history:lie-groups:04-su2-so3]",
        "canonical_path": "lie-groups/04-SU2-SO3.md",
        "concepts": "[su2, so3]",
        "current_path": "lie-groups/04-SU2-SO3.md",
        "id": "maxim:lie-groups:su2-so3",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "lie-groups",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[su2, so3]",
        "section": "lie-groups",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "SU(2) and SO(3) - Double Cover, Spinors, Angular Momentum",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "**The Pauli matrices** (sigma_i) are:\n```\nsigma_1 = [[0,1],[1,0]]    sigma_2 = [[0,-i],[i,0]]    sigma_3 = [[1,0],[0,-1]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "04-SU2-SO3.md#009",
      "path": [
        "04-SU2-SO3.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:lie-groups:04-su2-so3, git-history:lie-groups:04-su2-so3]",
        "canonical_path": "lie-groups/04-SU2-SO3.md",
        "concepts": "[su2, so3]",
        "current_path": "lie-groups/04-SU2-SO3.md",
        "id": "maxim:lie-groups:su2-so3",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "lie-groups",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[su2, so3]",
        "section": "lie-groups",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "SU(2) and SO(3) - Double Cover, Spinors, Angular Momentum",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Properties:\n  sigma_i^2 = I\n  sigma_i sigma_j = delta_{ij} I + i epsilon_{ijk} sigma_k\n  [sigma_i/2, sigma_j/2] = i epsilon_{ijk} sigma_k/2\n```"
    },
    {
      "id": "04-SU2-SO3.md#010",
      "path": [
        "04-SU2-SO3.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:lie-groups:04-su2-so3, git-history:lie-groups:04-su2-so3]",
        "canonical_path": "lie-groups/04-SU2-SO3.md",
        "concepts": "[su2, so3]",
        "current_path": "lie-groups/04-SU2-SO3.md",
        "id": "maxim:lie-groups:su2-so3",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "lie-groups",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[su2, so3]",
        "section": "lie-groups",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "SU(2) and SO(3) - Double Cover, Spinors, Angular Momentum",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "The Lie algebra su(2) = span_R{i sigma_1/2, i sigma_2/2, i sigma_3/2} with bracket\n[i sigma_a/2, i sigma_b/2] = epsilon_{abc} (i sigma_c/2). Isomorphic to so(3)."
    },
