        "title": "SU(2) and SO(3) - Double Cover, Spinors, Angular Momentum",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "## The Double Cover Map phi: SU(2) -> SO(3)"
    },
    {
      "id": "04-SU2-SO3.md#019",
      "path": [
        "04-SU2-SO3.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:lie-groups:04-su2-so3, git-history:lie-groups:04-su2-so3]",
        "canonical_path": "lie-groups/04-SU2-SO3.md",
        "concepts": "[su2, so3]",
        "current_path": "lie-groups/04-SU2-SO3.md",
        "id": "maxim:lie-groups:su2-so3",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "lie-groups",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[su2, so3]",
        "section": "lie-groups",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "SU(2) and SO(3) - Double Cover, Spinors, Angular Momentum",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "**Construction:** SU(2) acts on the 3-dimensional real vector space:\n```\nV = span_R{i sigma_1, i sigma_2, i sigma_3} iso R^3\n```\nby conjugation: X |-> A X A^{-1} for A in SU(2), X in V."
    },
    {
      "id": "04-SU2-SO3.md#020",
      "path": [
        "04-SU2-SO3.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:lie-groups:04-su2-so3, git-history:lie-groups:04-su2-so3]",
        "canonical_path": "lie-groups/04-SU2-SO3.md",
        "concepts": "[su2, so3]",
        "current_path": "lie-groups/04-SU2-SO3.md",
        "id": "maxim:lie-groups:su2-so3",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "lie-groups",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[su2, so3]",
        "section": "lie-groups",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "SU(2) and SO(3) - Double Cover, Spinors, Angular Momentum",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Since conjugation by A preserves V (check: conjugate of a traceless skew-Hermitian matrix is\ntraceless skew-Hermitian) and preserves the inner product B(X,Y) = -tr(XY)/2 on V, each A\ngives a rotation of R^3."
    },
    {
      "id": "04-SU2-SO3.md#021",
      "path": [
        "04-SU2-SO3.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:lie-groups:04-su2-so3, git-history:lie-groups:04-su2-so3]",
        "canonical_path": "lie-groups/04-SU2-SO3.md",
        "concepts": "[su2, so3]",
        "current_path": "lie-groups/04-SU2-SO3.md",
        "id": "maxim:lie-groups:su2-so3",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "lie-groups",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[su2, so3]",
        "section": "lie-groups",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "SU(2) and SO(3) - Double Cover, Spinors, Angular Momentum",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "**The map:** phi(A)(n_i sigma_i) = A (n_i sigma_i) A^{-1}"
    },
    {
      "id": "04-SU2-SO3.md#022",
      "path": [
        "04-SU2-SO3.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:lie-groups:04-su2-so3, git-history:lie-groups:04-su2-so3]",
        "canonical_path": "lie-groups/04-SU2-SO3.md",
        "concepts": "[su2, so3]",
        "current_path": "lie-groups/04-SU2-SO3.md",
        "id": "maxim:lie-groups:su2-so3",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "lie-groups",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[su2, so3]",
        "section": "lie-groups",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "SU(2) and SO(3) - Double Cover, Spinors, Angular Momentum",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "**Kernel:** phi(A) = I iff A commutes with all sigma_i. Since {sigma_i} generates all of M_2(C)\nas an algebra (they span the traceless Hermitian matrices), A must commute with all of M_2(C),\nhence A = lambda I. Since A in SU(2): lambda^2 = 1, lambda = pm 1. So ker(phi) = {I, -I} = Z_2."
    },
    {
      "id": "04-SU2-SO3.md#023",
      "path": [
        "04-SU2-SO3.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:lie-groups:04-su2-so3, git-history:lie-groups:04-su2-so3]",
        "canonical_path": "lie-groups/04-SU2-SO3.md",
        "concepts": "[su2, so3]",
        "current_path": "lie-groups/04-SU2-SO3.md",
        "id": "maxim:lie-groups:su2-so3",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "lie-groups",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[su2, so3]",
        "section": "lie-groups",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "SU(2) and SO(3) - Double Cover, Spinors, Angular Momentum",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Therefore: SO(3) iso SU(2) / {I, -I} = SU(2) / Z_2."
    },
    {
      "id": "04-SU2-SO3.md#024",
      "path": [
        "04-SU2-SO3.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:lie-groups:04-su2-so3, git-history:lie-groups:04-su2-so3]",
        "canonical_path": "lie-groups/04-SU2-SO3.md",
