        "section": "lie-groups",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "SU(2) and SO(3) - Double Cover, Spinors, Angular Momentum",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "## Why This Means Spinors Exist"
    },
    {
      "id": "04-SU2-SO3.md#026",
      "path": [
        "04-SU2-SO3.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:lie-groups:04-su2-so3, git-history:lie-groups:04-su2-so3]",
        "canonical_path": "lie-groups/04-SU2-SO3.md",
        "concepts": "[su2, so3]",
        "current_path": "lie-groups/04-SU2-SO3.md",
        "id": "maxim:lie-groups:su2-so3",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "lie-groups",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[su2, so3]",
        "section": "lie-groups",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "SU(2) and SO(3) - Double Cover, Spinors, Angular Momentum",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "**Representations must respect the kernel:** A representation rho: SO(3) -> GL(V) pulls back to\nrho.phi: SU(2) -> GL(V) via the covering map. For this to be a well-defined SO(3) rep, it must\nsatisfy rho(phi(A)) = rho(phi(-A)), i.e., rho.phi(A) = rho.phi(-A), i.e., rho.phi(-I) = I."
    },
    {
      "id": "04-SU2-SO3.md#027",
      "path": [
        "04-SU2-SO3.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:lie-groups:04-su2-so3, git-history:lie-groups:04-su2-so3]",
        "canonical_path": "lie-groups/04-SU2-SO3.md",
        "concepts": "[su2, so3]",
        "current_path": "lie-groups/04-SU2-SO3.md",
        "id": "maxim:lie-groups:su2-so3",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "lie-groups",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[su2, so3]",
        "section": "lie-groups",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "SU(2) and SO(3) - Double Cover, Spinors, Angular Momentum",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "The SU(2) element -I acts on the spin-j representation V_j by:\n```\nrho_j(-I) = (-1)^{2j} I\n```\n(because -I = exp(2pi i * J_3 / j) up to the right normalization — a full 2pi rotation sends\n|j,m> to e^{2pi i m} |j,m> = |j,m> for integer m and -|j,m> for half-integer m)."
    },
    {
      "id": "04-SU2-SO3.md#028",
      "path": [
        "04-SU2-SO3.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:lie-groups:04-su2-so3, git-history:lie-groups:04-su2-so3]",
        "canonical_path": "lie-groups/04-SU2-SO3.md",
        "concepts": "[su2, so3]",
        "current_path": "lie-groups/04-SU2-SO3.md",
        "id": "maxim:lie-groups:su2-so3",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "lie-groups",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[su2, so3]",
        "section": "lie-groups",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "SU(2) and SO(3) - Double Cover, Spinors, Angular Momentum",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "**Consequence:**\n- j in {0,1,2,...}: rho_j(-I) = I. The representation descends to SO(3). These are \"tensors.\"\n- j in {1/2, 3/2, 5/2,...}: rho_j(-I) = -I. Does NOT descend to SO(3). These are \"spinors.\""
    },
    {
      "id": "04-SU2-SO3.md#029",
      "path": [
        "04-SU2-SO3.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:lie-groups:04-su2-so3, git-history:lie-groups:04-su2-so3]",
        "canonical_path": "lie-groups/04-SU2-SO3.md",
        "concepts": "[su2, so3]",
        "current_path": "lie-groups/04-SU2-SO3.md",
        "id": "maxim:lie-groups:su2-so3",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "lie-groups",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[su2, so3]",
        "section": "lie-groups",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "SU(2) and SO(3) - Double Cover, Spinors, Angular Momentum",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "```\nINTEGER SPIN (tensors):\n  2pi rotation = identity\n  These are representations of SO(3)\n  Examples: scalars (j=0), vectors (j=1), symmetric tensors (j=2)"
    },
    {
      "id": "04-SU2-SO3.md#030",
      "path": [
        "04-SU2-SO3.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:lie-groups:04-su2-so3, git-history:lie-groups:04-su2-so3]",
        "canonical_path": "lie-groups/04-SU2-SO3.md",
        "concepts": "[su2, so3]",
        "current_path": "lie-groups/04-SU2-SO3.md",
        "id": "maxim:lie-groups:su2-so3",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "lie-groups",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[su2, so3]",
        "section": "lie-groups",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "SU(2) and SO(3) - Double Cover, Spinors, Angular Momentum",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "HALF-INTEGER SPIN (spinors):\n  2pi rotation = multiplication by -1\n  These are representations of SU(2) but NOT SO(3)\n  Examples: electrons (j=1/2), protons (j=1/2), quarks (j=1/2)\n```"
    },
    {
      "id": "04-SU2-SO3.md#031",
      "path": [
        "04-SU2-SO3.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:lie-groups:04-su2-so3, git-history:lie-groups:04-su2-so3]",
        "canonical_path": "lie-groups/04-SU2-SO3.md",
        "concepts": "[su2, so3]",
        "current_path": "lie-groups/04-SU2-SO3.md",
        "id": "maxim:lie-groups:su2-so3",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "lie-groups",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[su2, so3]",
        "section": "lie-groups",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "SU(2) and SO(3) - Double Cover, Spinors, Angular Momentum",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Spinors are not a quirk of quantum mechanics — they are forced by the topology of SO(3).\nThe topological obstruction is pi_1(SO(3)) = Z/2Z: the double cover SU(2) exists because of this\nfundamental group. Representations of the cover that do not factor through the base are spinorial."
    }
  ],
